# Textures

Vanilla kanims here: Trilinear + mipmaps. This player rejects nearest/pixel-art upscaling and notices minify shimmer.

- `new Texture2D(..., mipChain: true)` then `Apply(true, false)`; `FilterMode.Trilinear`
- Magnify: bilinear. Minify: area/box, not 4-tap bilinear
- Do not stamp 2048 CPU atlases per skin; 512 (2× 256) is the current cap
- Clone kanim: keep template UVs (0–1), `maxGroupSize = 1`, copy wrap/aniso from vanilla
- Hide drywall caps via symbol visibility; crop 9-slice interiors (~1/6 inset)
